OL,3,GNEWSAHospice team to run half marathon
OL,4,Ato fund #200K bed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care team from a children's hospice
OL,7,Fhope to raise #200,000 by running a
OL,8,Fhalf marathon dressed as beds.
OL,10,FFour runners from Helen and Douglas
OL,11,FHouse in Oxford will take on the Oxford
OL,12,FHalf, aiming to raise enough money to
OL,13,Fpay for a hospice bed for a year.
OL,15,FThe specially made costumes, decorated
OL,16,Fby patients, come complete with
OL,17,Fpillows, duvets, nightcaps and teddy
OL,18,Fbears.
OL,20,FMedical Director, Dr Emily Harrop, is
OL,21,Fone of those taking part and said she
OL,22,Fhoped to spread joy along the course.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
